⨯ incompatible-annotations: union discriminator `Data` cannot be both @non_serialized and @key
  @ test.idl:2:7

 2 │ union Data switch (@key @non_serialized long) {
   │       ˆˆˆˆ          ˆˆˆ  ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ @non_serialized annotation here
   │       │             └─ @key annotation here
   │       └─ incompatible annotations on union discriminator
 3 │     case 0: @external @optional long a;
 4 │     case 1: @optional @shared long b;

  ? remove either @non_serialized or @key

⨯ incompatible-annotations: union variant `a` cannot be both @optional and @external
